{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "383c4d496f8b4895547b928583bb90594592d1a21c0a1dbadc275fb555a3d934", "ja": "（やよいのライブが終わった。明るく元気で、\nそれでいて安定感もバッチリのステージだったな！）", "zh": "（弥生的演唱会结束了。\n是场开朗又有活力，同时又充满安定感的表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "55b3776652d743a56985aa490499d4006eeb01285fd0a2060d5725b8bbdcb2a7", "ja": "うっうー！　{$P$}！\nお疲れさまでしたの……ハイ、ターッチ！", "zh": "呜呜──！{$P$}！\n你辛苦了……好，击──掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_1002", "source_sha256": "84c29e7000290de00eaf61887e7ab5f7a175ed6d7a15577b604d361cb5338884", "ja": "ハイタッチ！", "zh": "好，击掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2000_005yay", "source_sha256": "569748b3711cd325e46487fc3f1d9ab4082981ba840c77b60edd4179ed3d80fe", "ja": "いぇい！\n{$P$}も、楽しんでくれましたか？", "zh": "耶！\n{$P$}看得还开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2001_p", "source_sha256": "cbbbc87de5a0f3875271dd8b615ec490430a914d05f560a4d9304c7210c56567", "ja": "ああ、とっても楽しかったよ。やよいのご家族の\nみなさんも、楽しんでくれてたみたいだぞ！", "zh": "嗯，我非常开心。\n弥生的家人好像也看得很开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2002_005yay", "source_sha256": "21257ccac30266252bca464036a36f588bf7c10f7bb3c104a81b73568913231f", "ja": "ホントですか？　えへへっ、\nなんか恥ずかしいですけど、うれしいかも……。", "zh": "真的吗？\n嘿嘿，虽然有点害羞，但我好高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2003_005yay", "source_sha256": "8a94f41cf7004a4496af23efd359a3322d471b9ad486373f3f5404f371d16776", "ja": "{$P$}、今回はうちの家族を\n招待してくれて、ありがとうございましたっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，这次能招待我的家人来，\n我真的很感谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2004_p", "source_sha256": "6a1b208a6ed90fb3d13efefe9046c78ad437766bf4bdbf33a1a3d6abf1fe63fe", "ja": "とんでもない。本当は毎回チケットを送っても\nいいんだけど、いろいろ都合があるだろうからな。", "zh": "不会啦。其实要每次都送票过去也没问题，\n但你的家人应该也有事要忙吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2005_005yay", "source_sha256": "c6b6cf1ef8acc92ad2dc8be2f232339e1ce0bbeb59881c78ece5ca77472d5e92", "ja": "今日はたまたま、お母さんのお仕事がお休みで、しかも\n妹たちの小学校も創立記念日で、よかったですー。", "zh": "今天刚好妈妈的工作休假，\n弟弟妹妹上的小学又正好碰到创校纪念日，真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2006_005yay", "source_sha256": "acb73ab544a2372a7627d125920a1a5fe37b367d4e1296f74a4a46ad95c068a1", "ja": "私がアイドルのお仕事してるところって、\n家族には、あんまり見せられてなくて……。", "zh": "我从事偶像工作时的样子，\n很少能让家人看见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2007_005yay", "source_sha256": "737fa8b24ad1f25969ed87a06d4a5ea2e11b277c54a635a0dfa7b917d2e7abe4", "ja": "だから、今日は私もうれしかったですっ。\nもう一回、ありがとうございましたっ！", "zh": "所以能有今天的机会，我就够高兴了！\n我要再次感谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2008_p", "source_sha256": "45f5dadbea1bebc611d7e288159f82eca0b9efe7dcdc34cd2c6954fdc6978853", "ja": "どういたしまして。\nこれからも、たくさん見てもらおうな！", "zh": "不客气。\n今后也要让他们见到更多你的活跃表现喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2009_005yay", "source_sha256": "4feb9a665873c3910278d16dbe34adec4460b7960307b276aa5034434bfdf2b3", "ja": "はいっ！　それじゃ私、着替えてきますね。\nライブの後片付けしなきゃっ。", "zh": "好的！那我去换衣服了。\n还有演唱会的撤场工作要忙呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2010_p", "source_sha256": "c893e60535c3ddb017aa49556b76013a003be3712de818bcef0ff9e40f189842", "ja": "え？　いや、せっかくなんだから、\n今日は家族と一緒に帰ったらどうだ？", "zh": "咦？不用啦，难得有这个机会，\n你今天就跟家人一起回去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2011_005yay", "source_sha256": "4480f72b04fe7ce462538e6d03768e1fefa332fcf28e341aa83908d91fa3d7a9", "ja": "ダメです～。私、いつも弟達に、散らかしたらちゃんと\n自分で片付けなさいって言ってますしっ。", "zh": "不行～我平常都会跟弟弟们说，\n弄乱了要自己收拾好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2012_p", "source_sha256": "168fab02ffb5ef729146e76bdca9ee3675221b738388c1c8fe6eb3eee47b61f6", "ja": "いやでも、やよいが散らかしたわけじゃないし……。", "zh": "可是又不是弥生弄乱的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2013_005yay", "source_sha256": "5b4e18e58bb36c084efb1e2e34389be8adbdcecfaf9ba72597ec203e559a19fb", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、メッ、ですよ！\nそういうのは、ちょっと自分勝手かなーって。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，不可以喔！\n我觉得这样有点太自私了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2014_005yay", "source_sha256": "e3be8fe67785cd2f56ae1450ccbbafdae66afae51d0c5e38aba1a65cb50c15a8", "ja": "それに、みんな一緒の方が、早く終わりますよね？\nみんなでパパパーってお片付け、しちゃいましょー！", "zh": "而且大家一起收拾，就能早点结束对吧？\n大家一起来咻咻～地收拾干净吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2015_p", "source_sha256": "62250d99c9d67c499787fc7bd4cd6635b6a64ea4cf2f9c4afe1bbebd0d811209", "ja": "……そうだな、ごめんごめん。やよいの言う通りだ。\nよし、パパパーっと、手早く終わらせよう！", "zh": "……说得也是，抱歉抱歉，弥生你说得对。\n好，就来咻咻～地快速搞定吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2016_005yay", "source_sha256": "3bda2497d04bd756541eb4c31dd52de67654fe279d6d5f66c9068abbb0199f6a", "ja": "そうしましょー！\nそれじゃ、パパパーって着替えてきますねっ♪", "zh": "就这么办吧──！\n那我先去咻咻～地换衣服了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2017_p", "source_sha256": "0861038e888050edd88d35632a4193ad3f7d3a46df405fc3a1894357f9dc397b", "ja": "（アイドルの衣装を着ていても、やよいがしっかり者の\nお姉さんなことは変わらないらしい）", "zh": "（看来就算穿着偶像的服装，\n弥生是可靠的姊姊这一点也不会改变呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0054_2018_p", "source_sha256": "aeed7bd0de7c7ec2ffd39b80a3a788d5e5995f8cc01953f749508c84faede1f8", "ja": "（せめて少しでも早く、家族の元に返してあげないと。\nさて、先に片づけを始めるとするか！）", "zh": "（至少要早一点让她回到家人的身边才行。\n好了，我先开始着手收拾吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
